# Nothing here is required.
#
# The app works out of the box on a phone, a simulator and an emulator: it takes
# the API host from the machine Expo served the bundle from, which is the machine
# running `pnpm dev`. See lib/resolve-api-url.ts.
#
# Set this only to override that — a deployed backend, or a network where the
# device cannot reach Metro's address. Leave it unset otherwise; pinning
# localhost here points the app at the phone itself and every request fails.
#
#   Deployed:        https://sanad.example.edu
#   Laptop over LAN: http://192.168.1.42:3000
#   Android emulator: http://10.0.2.2:3000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SANAD_API_URL=
